WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:14,680
Concerning the metastasis of cancer to the lungs question from last week, I've tried the

00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:19,440
nebulized hydro-aproxide as described by Marcola.

00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:23,440
Since I'm due to this, how long and how often should I do this?

00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,320
So your little nebulizer should only fill up about an ounce of fluid.

00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:34,080
You do that, it takes about 10 minutes, maybe 15 minutes to get through that nebulized hydro-aproxide.

00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:38,320
And you could do this three, four times a day if you want.

00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:43,480
I wouldn't do any longer than that, I wouldn't do any more than that.

00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:49,160
But certainly, you could do it three or four times a day, space it out a couple hours

00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:53,600
between times that you're doing that.

00:00:53,600 --> 00:01:01,680
I would say, yes, can you do nebulized iodine or nebulized baking soda for alkalization?

00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:10,620
I don't know, you'd have to look up a recipe for baking soda.

00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:16,540
That's a possibility, I don't know the recipe for that.

00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:23,140
Iodine, you could, I don't think iodine is going to be a drug killer for cancer that's in the lungs though.

00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:28,260
So I would not do the iodine, I would stick to hydrogen peroxide.

00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:37,500
